From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Active ESL <engineering@active-esl.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] base: Keep reflectively loaded WayDroid services

WaySystemServer obtains the WayDroid service class name from
config_externalWayDroidServices and passes it to SystemServiceManager as a
string. R8 cannot see that reflective reference and removes WayDroidService
from services.jar when system Java shrinking is enabled.

Keep the WayDroid server package so the configured service remains available
to the system_server class loader at runtime.
---
 services/proguard.flags | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/services/proguard.flags b/services/proguard.flags
index 8f2722d..7363924 100644
--- a/services/proguard.flags
+++ b/services/proguard.flags
@@ -125,4 +125,5 @@
 -keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class vendor.lineage.** { *; }
 
 # Waydroid
+-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class id.waydro.server.** { *; }
 -dontwarn vendor.waydroid.**
-- 
2.51.0

